  "fullContentHtml": "<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-b39c368c\">\n<div class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-60ccea19 gb-headline-text\"><table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; height: 225px;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr style=\"height: 36px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 22.6212%; text-align: center; height: 36px; border-style: none;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Name Of Post :</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 77.3788%; height: 36px; border-style: none;\">\n<h1><strong>Delhi DSSSB Latest Result, Marks, Cutoff and E-Dossier Form 2026</strong></h1>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 22px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 22.6212%; text-align: center; height: 35px; border-style: none;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Post Date / Update :</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 77.3788%; height: 35px; border-style: none;\">11 June 2026 | 07:21 PM</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 154px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 22.6212%; text-align: center; height: 154px; border-style: none;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Short Information </strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 77.3788%; height: 154px; border-style: none; vertical-align: middle;\">\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Delhi Subordinate Service Selection Board has released the Latest Result, Old Results, and E-Dossier Form for various posts. Candidates who appeared in the examination can check their result, marks, and cutoff details through the official methods. Qualified candidates are required to complete the E-Dossier Form as per the instructions provided in the official notice. It is advised to read the complete notification carefully for all details related to result status, cutoff, and further recruitment process before proceeding.</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n\n\n\n\n<div class=\"social-grid\">\n\n<div class=\"social-box telegram\">\n    <div class=\"social-left\">\n        <img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://cdn-icons-png.flaticon.com/512/2111/2111646.png\">\n        <span>Telegram</span>\n    </div>\n    <a href=\"https://t.me/SarkariResult2012\" class=\"social-btn\">Join Us</a>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"social-box whatsapp\">\n    <div class=\"social-left\">\n        <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://cdn-icons-png.flaticon.com/512/733/733585.png\">\n        <span>WhatsApp</span>\n    </div>\n    <a href=\"https://www.whatsapp.com/channel/0029Va5IElwBlHpVBd6i5a18\" class=\"social-btn\">Join Us</a>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"social-box instagram\">\n    <div class=\"social-left\">\n        <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://cdn-icons-png.flaticon.com/512/2111/2111463.png\">\n        <span>Instagram</span>\n    </div>\n    \n</div>\n\n<div class=\"social-box twitter\">\n    <div class=\"social-left\">\n        <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://cdn-icons-png.flaticon.com/512/5968/5968958.png\">\n        <span>X</span>\n    </div>\n    <a href=\"https://x.com/srofficial2012\" class=\"social-btn\">Follow</a>\n</div>\n\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div id=\"v-sarkariresult\"></div>\n\n\n\n\n<div class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-48617a69 gb-headline-text\"><table border=\"1\" width=\"781\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"5\" valign=\"top\" width=\"781\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><b><span style=\"color: #ff00ff;\">Delhi Subordinate Service Selection Board (DSSSB)</span> </b><b></b></h2>\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\"><b>DSSSB Results | Cutoff | Marks | Score Card 2026</b></span><b></b></h2>\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff;\"><b>DSSSB 2026 Result : Short Details of Notification</b></span><b></b></h2>\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><b> | </b></span><b></b></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"379\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\"><b>Exam Conducted By</b></span><b></b></h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Delhi Subordinate Service Selection Board DSSSB Are Conducted the Various Recruitment Exam in Every Year.</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"402\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\"><b>Application Fee</b></span><b></b></h2>\n<ul>\n<li>No Application Fee to Check the DSSSB Latest Results, Cutoff, Marks and Score Card.</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"5\" valign=\"top\" width=\"781\">\n\n<ul>\n<li>DSSSB (Delhi Subordinate Services Selection Board) exam results can be checked easily through Sarkari Result®. Candidates searching for Sarkari Result DSSSB Result 2026 can follow the methods below to check their result, marks, and cutoff details.</li>\n<li>There are two main methods to check DSSSB results – first through PDF and second by logging into the DSSSB online portal.</li>\n<li><strong>First : DSSSB Result PDF Method</strong><br data-start=\"546\" data-end=\"549\">In many cases, DSSSB releases the result in PDF format. Candidates need to download the PDF and search their roll number using the Ctrl + F option. If the roll number is found in the list, the candidate is considered qualified.</li>\n<li><strong>Second : DSSSB Online Portal Login Method</strong><br data-start=\"817\" data-end=\"820\">Some results are available through the DSSSB online portal where candidates can check their scorecard, marks, and detailed result.</li>\n<li>To login, candidates need to enter:</li>\n<li>Date of Birth</li>\n<li>Class 10 Roll Number</li>\n<li>Passing Year</li>\n<li>Password created during the application process</li>\n<li>After logging in, click on the “View Result” tab to check your result and marks.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>For the latest updates on DSSSB Result, Admit Card, Answer Key, and Cutoff, always visit SarkariResult.com, the official website for Sarkari Result® in India (Since 2012).</p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"5\" valign=\"top\" width=\"781\"><center><br>\n<!-- 300 x 250 mar 23 --><br>\n<br>\n</center><p></p>\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\"><b>DSSSB Important Note (Qualified Candidate)</b></span></h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Candidates who qualify in the DSSSB examination may be required to fill the E-Dossier Form. Complete details will be available in the official result or cutoff notice.</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"5\" valign=\"top\" width=\"781\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff;\"><b>Enrolled Candidate Can Download the Delhi DSSSB Latest Result 2026.</b></span><b></b></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"5\" valign=\"top\" width=\"781\">\n\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"415\">\n\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"366\">\n\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"5\" valign=\"top\" width=\"781\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\"><b>Some Useful Important Links</b></span><b></b></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"4\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff;\"><strong>Fill E Dossier Form</strong></span></h2>\n</td>\n<td>\n<h2 align=\"center\"><a title=\"DSSSB E Dossier Form\" href=\"https://dsssbonline.nic.in/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Click Here</b></span></a></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td valign=\"top\" width=\"234\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\"><b>Result Date</b></span></h2>\n<p>&nbsp;</p></td>\n<td colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"201\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><b>Result Details</b></span><b></b></h2>\n</td>\n<td valign=\"top\" width=\"347\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><b>Download Link</b></span><b></b></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\"><b>11/06/2026</b></span></h2>\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"3\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">Naib Tehsildar 26/25</span></h2>\n</td>\n<td>\n<h2 align=\"center\"><b><a title=\"DSSSB  Result\" href=\"https://dsssb.delhi.gov.in/sites/default/files/DSSSB/universal-tab/26_25.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"no